---
// DRAFT PRIVACY POLICY — requires legal review before publication.
// Placeholders marked [...] must be replaced before launch.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — OOPUO"
  description="How OOPUO collects, uses, and protects your personal data in accordance with the GDPR."
>
  <section class="bg-bg-primary py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-[var(--max-width-site)] mx-auto px-6">
      <SectionLabel class="mb-4 block">Legal</SectionLabel>
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-hero max-w-4xl mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-caption text-text-muted mb-12">
        Last updated: [PRIVACY_POLICY_DATE] &middot;
        <span class="text-highlight-warm">DRAFT — This document requires legal review before publication.</span>
      </p>

      <div class="max-w-[720px] space-y-12 text-text-secondary text-body-lg leading-relaxed">

        <!-- 1. Who we are -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            OOPUO is a sole-trader AI consultancy registered in the Netherlands. References to "we", "us", or "OOPUO" in this policy mean:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 list-none pl-0">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Legal entity:</strong> [LEGAL_ENTITY_FULL_NAME]</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Registered address:</strong> [REGISTERED_ADDRESS], Amsterdam, Netherlands</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>KVK number:</strong> [KVK_NUMBER]</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Privacy contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@oopuo.com" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2">hello@oopuo.com</a></span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We act as the <strong>data controller</strong> for personal data collected through this website.
            No Data Protection Officer (DPO) is currently appointed; the contact above handles all privacy matters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. What we collect -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">2. What personal data we collect</h2>

          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">2.1 Data you give us directly</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-none pl-0 mb-6">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Contact / enquiry form</strong> (powered by HubSpot, subject to your cookie consent): name, business email address, company name, and the content of your message.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Meeting scheduling</strong> (powered by Calendly, subject to your cookie consent): name, email address, and any notes you add when booking a call.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Direct email</strong> to hello@oopuo.com: whatever you include in your message.</span></li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">2.2 Data collected automatically</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-none pl-0">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Server logs:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URL, and pages visited. Retained for up to 30 days for security purposes by our hosting provider ([HOSTING_PROVIDER]).</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> see Section 5 and our <a href="#cookies" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2">Cookie section</a>.</span></li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-4">We do <strong>not</strong> collect special-category data (health, political opinions, ethnicity, etc.) through this website.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Why we collect it -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">3. Why we collect it (lawful basis)</h2>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-caption border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-border-visible">
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-text-muted py-3 pr-6 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Purpose</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-text-muted py-3 pr-6 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Lawful basis (GDPR Art. 6)</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-border-subtle">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Respond to enquiries and book consultations</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">Art. 6(1)(b) — necessary to take pre-contractual steps at your request</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Deliver contracted consulting services</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">Art. 6(1)(b) — performance of a contract</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Send follow-up or marketing communications (if opted in)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">Art. 6(1)(a) — consent (you may withdraw at any time)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Website security and fraud prevention</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">Art. 6(1)(f) — legitimate interests</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Analytics to improve the site</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">Art. 6(1)(a) — consent via cookie banner</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Legal obligations (tax records, invoices)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">Art. 6(1)(c) — legal obligation</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Retention -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">4. How long we keep data</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 list-none pl-0">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Enquiry / lead data:</strong> up to 2 years from last contact, unless we enter a contractual relationship.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Client data:</strong> 7 years from the end of the engagement, in line with Dutch tax-record obligations (Belastingdienst).</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Server logs:</strong> up to 30 days.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Marketing consent records:</strong> until you withdraw consent, then 3 years for proof-of-consent purposes.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Cookies -->
        <div id="cookies">
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">5. Cookies</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">We use the following cookie categories. You can manage your preferences at any time via the <button onclick="window.oopuoOpenCookieSettings && window.oopuoOpenCookieSettings()" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-hover bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer p-0 text-body-lg">cookie settings panel</button>.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 list-none pl-0">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> cookie-consent preference stored in localStorage (no server transfer).</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Functional (consent required):</strong> Calendly session cookies to enable scheduling embeds. Processor: Calendly LLC, USA. Transfer mechanism: EU Standard Contractual Clauses.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Analytics (consent required):</strong> No analytics service is currently active. If we add Plausible Analytics or Google Analytics in the future, this policy will be updated and re-consent requested.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Marketing (consent required):</strong> HubSpot tracking pixel and form cookies. Processor: HubSpot Inc., USA. Transfer mechanism: EU Standard Contractual Clauses.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Recipients -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">6. Who receives your data (sub-processors)</h2>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-caption border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-border-visible">
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-text-muted py-3 pr-6 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Processor</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-text-muted py-3 pr-6 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Purpose</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-text-muted py-3 uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Country</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-border-subtle">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">[HOSTING_PROVIDER]</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-secondary">Static site hosting &amp; server logs</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">[HOSTING_COUNTRY]</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">HubSpot Inc.</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-secondary">Lead capture forms (consent-gated)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">USA — SCCs</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Calendly LLC</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-secondary">Meeting scheduling (consent-gated)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">USA — SCCs</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-primary">Microsoft / ProtonMail / [EMAIL_PROVIDER]</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-text-secondary">Email communications</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-text-secondary">[EMAIL_COUNTRY]</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-caption text-text-muted">We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. International transfers -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">7. International transfers</h2>
          <p>Where data is transferred outside the European Economic Area (EEA), we rely on EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) as adopted by the European Commission. Relevant sub-processors (HubSpot, Calendly) maintain SCCs and are subject to the EU–US Data Privacy Framework where applicable.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Your rights -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">8. Your rights under the GDPR</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">If you are in the EEA or UK, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 list-none pl-0">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Access</strong> a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Rectification</strong> of inaccurate or incomplete data.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Erasure</strong> ("right to be forgotten") — subject to legal-retention obligations.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Restriction</strong> of processing while a dispute is resolved.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Data portability</strong> in a machine-readable format where processing is based on consent or contract.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Objection</strong> to processing based on legitimate interests.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&loz;</span><span><strong>Withdrawal of consent</strong> at any time without affecting the lawfulness of prior processing.</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">To exercise any right, submit a request at <a href="/privacy/contact" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2">/privacy/contact</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@oopuo.com" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2">hello@oopuo.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days. We may ask you to verify your identity before processing sensitive requests.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Complaint authority -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">9. Right to complain</h2>
          <p>You have the right to lodge a complaint with the Dutch supervisory authority:</p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            <strong>Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens (AP)</strong><br />
            Postbus 93374, 2509 AJ Den Haag<br />
            <a href="https://www.autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 10. Changes -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-4">10. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We will update this policy when our data practices change and bump the version date at the top. If changes are material, we will re-prompt cookie consent where required. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy for non-consent-based processing.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 11. Contact -->
        <div class="p-6 bg-bg-elevated border border-border-subtle rounded-[var(--radius-md)]">
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-h3 text-text-primary mb-3">Contact us about privacy</h2>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@oopuo.com" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2">hello@oopuo.com</a></p>
          <p class="mt-2">Data Subject Access Request form: <a href="/privacy/contact" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover underline underline-offset-2">/privacy/contact</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
